# Coverage
coverage/

# The gen-l10n report of keys present in the template and missing from a
# translation (see l10n.yaml). A build artifact, regenerated on every run — CI
# fails when it is non-empty. The *generated* localizations under
# lib/l10n/generated/ are deliberately NOT ignored: they are committed and
# diffed the same way the Drift/Riverpod .g.dart files are, so a stale
# translation table fails the build instead of surfacing as a missing string.
l10n_untranslated.json
